{%- comment -%}
  SHOKOGI — "The Fleet": the two real Sea-Doo jet skis (GTX Limited 300 + Wake
  Pro), shown as illustrations with a gentle float. Self-contained section added
  to the two foil pages. Loads sk.css + the foil polish layer (skplusfoil.css,
  scoped to .skp — only ever loaded here) + the real brand font weights, so the
  whole foil page also gets the polish.
{%- endcomment -%}
{{ 'sk.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{{ 'skplusfoil.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{{ 'skplusfoil2.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@600;700&family=Figtree:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap">
<div class="skp">
  <div class="sec"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker" style="text-align:center">the fleet</div>
    <h2>Our Jet Ski Tow-In Fleet</h2>
    <p class="lead">Every tow-in session runs behind professional, supercharged Sea-Doo watercraft &mdash; the power and control that put you on more waves.</p>
    <div class="fleet">
      <div class="fcard">
        <div class="fscene"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0116/5364/4354/files/shokogi-foil-gtx-300.jpg?v=1792868186" width="1200" height="600" loading="lazy" alt="Sea-Doo GTX Limited 300 jet ski"></div>
        <div class="fmeta">
          <div class="fbrand">Sea-Doo</div>
          <h3>GTX Limited 300</h3>
          <p>Our flagship tow sled &mdash; supercharged power and a planted, three-up hull that holds a rock-steady line while you ride.</p>
          <div class="fchips"><span class="fchip hp">300 HP</span><span class="fchip">Supercharged Rotax</span><span class="fchip">3-up stability</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="fcard">
        <div class="fscene"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0116/5364/4354/files/shokogi-foil-wake-pro.jpg?v=1792868186" width="1200" height="600" loading="lazy" alt="Sea-Doo Wake Pro jet ski with tow pylon"></div>
        <div class="fmeta">
          <div class="fbrand">Sea-Doo</div>
          <h3>Wake Pro</h3>
          <p>Built for tow sports &mdash; a retractable ski pylon and a strong, smooth pull make it the ideal partner for foil tow-ins.</p>
          <div class="fchips"><span class="fchip hp">230 HP</span><span class="fchip">Supercharged</span><span class="fchip">Retractable ski pylon</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="geardiv">
      <div class="kicker" style="text-align:center">tow gear</div>
      <h2>Our Tow Gear</h2>
      <div class="geargrid">
        <div class="fcard">
          <div class="gscene2"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0116/5364/4354/files/armstrong-tow-rope.jpg?v=1792872510" width="1600" height="800" loading="lazy" alt="Armstrong tow rope and handle for tow-in foil surfing"></div>
          <div class="fmeta">
            <div class="fbrand">Armstrong</div>
            <h3>Tow Rope &amp; Handle</h3>
            <p>The tow line we run on every session &mdash; a strong braided rope with a padded, textured grip handle, plus a storage strap to keep it coiled and ready between tow-ins.</p>
            <div class="fchips"><span class="fchip">Braided tow line</span><span class="fchip">Padded grip handle</span><span class="fchip">Storage strap</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="fcard">
          <div class="gscene2"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0116/5364/4354/files/jettech-tow-board.jpg?v=1792873921" width="1100" height="1100" loading="lazy" alt="JETTECH tow board for jet ski tow-in foil surfing"></div>
          <div class="fmeta">
            <div class="fbrand">JETTECH</div>
            <h3>Tow Board</h3>
            <p>Our tow board for the ride out &mdash; a grippy EVA deck with grab handles all around and bungee lacing to stow gear, plus secure foot straps for the tow behind the ski.</p>
            <div class="fchips"><span class="fchip">Grippy EVA deck</span><span class="fchip">Grab handles</span><span class="fchip">Bungee gear lacing</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="fcard">
          <div class="gscene2"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0116/5364/4354/files/brp-tow-pylon.jpg?v=1792874643" width="1100" height="1100" loading="lazy" alt="BRP tow pylon for jet ski tow-in foil surfing"></div>
          <div class="fmeta">
            <div class="fbrand">BRP</div>
            <h3>Tow Pylon</h3>
            <p>Raises the tow point so the line pulls high and clean above the water &mdash; height-adjustable with a swivel base for a steadier, more direct pull on every tow-in.</p>
            <div class="fchips"><span class="fchip">Raised tow point</span><span class="fchip">Height-adjustable</span><span class="fchip">Swivel base</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div></div>
</div>
